Replay of the TLC counterexample (v0 P-J-u1 / v1 P-J-full) on the port:
  after blank ack    committed=(1, 0) vector=[(2, (1, 0)), (1, (1, 0)), (3, (0, -1))]
  after upgrade      committed=(0, -1) vector=[(1, (1, 0)), (2, (1, 0)), (3, (0, -1))]
  leader self (1,1)  committed=(0, -1) vector=[(1, (1, 0)), (2, (1, 1)), (3, (0, -1))]
  n3 ack (1,1)       committed=(1, 1) vector=[(1, (1, 0)), (2, (1, 1)), (3, (1, 1))]
  => VecProgress committed (1, 1); GreatestQuorumValue (1, 0)
exit=1

